  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme titled Sustaining the Gains: Strengthening Accountability to Gender Equality &amp; Women&#x2019;s Rights in Zimbabwe is a joint programme implemented by 4 agencies (UNDP, UNWOMEN, UNFPA and UNICEF) funded by the European Union with co-financing from the Swiss Agency for Development &amp; Cooperation SDC. The 2 year joint programme will directly contribute to the implementation of Zimbabwe&#x2019;s High-Level Political Compact on Ending Gender-Based Violence &amp; Harmful Practices (HLPC) (2021-2030), one</narrative>
